@gateway = https://localhost
@forecast = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@companyId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@accountId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333
@jobId = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
@resultId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### Browser: сначала GET CSRF с credentials. Set-Cookie/токен взять из ответа.
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth-profile/auth/csrf
Origin: https://localhost

### Browser: auth code. В примере подставьте действительные cookie и CSRF из bootstrap.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth-profile/auth/code
Origin: https://localhost
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: <csrf-token>
Cookie: __Host-cashflow-csrf=<csrf-cookie>

{"email":"user@example.com"}

### Защищённый multipart. Демонстрационный пример для REST Client.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/preprocessor/statements/prepare
Origin: https://localhost
X-CSRF-Token: <csrf-token>
Cookie: __Host-cashflow-access=<jwt>; __Host-cashflow-csrf=<csrf-cookie>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

company_id;operation_id;operation_date;amount;direction;counterparty_inn;counterparty_name;payment_purpose;balance_eod
DEMO;DEMO-1;2026-09-30;990.00;Списание;0012345678;Тестовый банк;Комиссия за ведение счета;1000.00
--boundary--

### Stage imports: тело должно быть РЕАЛЬНЫМ response от prepare, а не эта строка.
# POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orchestrator/companies/{{companyId}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/imports
# Content-Type: application/json
# Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
# <полный JSON от Preprocessor>

### Request job. Не создаётся без подходящего company/account/history и авторизации.
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/orchestrator/companies/{{companyId}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/forecast-jobs
Origin: https://localhost
X-CSRF-Token: <csrf-token>
Cookie: __Host-cashflow-access=<jwt>; __Host-cashflow-csrf=<csrf-cookie>
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{"asOfDate":"2026-10-24","scope":"WITH_KNOWN_PLANS"}

### Internal: calculation. Подключить фикстуру через clients HTTP после локального checkout.
POST {{forecast}}/internal/v1/forecast/calculate
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{resultId}}

< ../../services/forecast/src/test/resources/fixtures/calculate.json

### Internal: backtest
POST {{forecast}}/internal/v1/forecast/backtest
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{resultId}}

< ../../services/forecast/src/test/resources/fixtures/backtest.json

### Internal: recurring detection (это ещё НЕ публичный gateway маршрут)
POST {{forecast}}/internal/v1/forecast/recurring-detection
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{jobId}}
X-Job-Id: {{jobId}}
X-Calculation-Id: {{jobId}}

< ../../services/forecast/src/test/resources/fixtures/recurring-detection.json

### NEW in merged PR #21: synchronous Preprocessor upload (SERVICE endpoint, NOT ROUTED by Gateway main)
# For trusted internal integration testing only; never expose Preprocessor directly to untrusted browsers.
# PREPROCESSOR_ORCHESTRATOR_URL must point to http://orchestrator:8083 in container networks.
POST http://127.0.0.1:8082/api/v1/preprocessor/companies/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/imports
X-User-Id: cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc
Idempotency-Key: dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary2

--boundary2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

company_id;operation_id;operation_date;amount;direction;counterparty_inn;counterparty_name;payment_purpose;balance_eod
DEMO;DEMO-1;2026-09-30;990.00;Списание;0012345678;Тестовый банк;Комиссия за ведение счета;1000.00
--boundary2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="accountId"

bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb
--boundary2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="validationMode"

SKIP_INVALID
--boundary2
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="completeness"

UNKNOWN
--boundary2--

### NEW in merged PR #23: Gateway OrchestratorCompat query-scoped route
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/orchestrator/companies/{{companyId}}/payments?accountId={{accountId}}&limit=20
Cookie: __Host-cashflow-access=<jwt>
